    {
      "index": 1,
      "seconds": 6,
      "caption": {
        "en": "Under Article 200, the Governor has four options.",
        "hi": "अनुच्छेद 200 के तहत राज्यपाल के पास चार विकल्प हैं।"
      },
      "state": {
        "tiles": "all shown",
        "end": "hidden"
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "seconds": 6,
      "caption": {
        "en": "One: give assent. The bill becomes law.",
        "hi": "पहला: सहमति देना। विधेयक क़ानून बन जाता है।"
      },
      "state": {
        "tiles": "0 highlighted, others dimmed",
        "tileSub": 0,
        "legislature": "dimmed"
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "seconds": 5,
      "caption": {
        "en": "Two: withhold assent.",
        "hi": "दूसरा: सहमति रोक लेना।"
      },
      "state": {
        "tiles": "1 highlighted, others dimmed",
        "legislature": "dimmed"
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "seconds": 10,
      "caption": {
        "en": "Three: return it for reconsideration, unless it is a Money Bill. If the House passes it again, the Governor cannot withhold assent.",
        "hi": "तीसरा: पुनर्विचार के लिए लौटाना, अगर वह धन विधेयक न हो। सदन दोबारा पारित कर दे, तो राज्यपाल सहमति नहीं रोक सकते।"
      },
      "state": {
        "tiles": "2 highlighted, others dimmed",
        "tileSub": 2,
        "legislature": "dimmed"
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "seconds": 10,
      "caption": {
        "en": "Four: reserve it for the President. This is required if the bill would reduce the powers of the High Court.",
        "hi": "चौथा: राष्ट्रपति के विचार के लिए सुरक्षित रखना। अगर विधेयक हाई कोर्ट की शक्तियाँ घटाता हो, तो ऐसा करना ज़रूरी है।"
      },
      "state": {
        "tiles": "3 highlighted, others dimmed",
        "tileSub": 3,
        "legislature": "dimmed"
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "seconds": 5,
